  {
    "row": 774,
    "type": "NOTE:TNAM",
    "editor": "MegatonCromwellBringingDivision",
    "en": "I often ask myself if the time is right for the second Division. Here, in Atom's blessed village, are we truly ready for his coming? Have I properly prepared my people for the moment in which his great altar cracks open and reveals to us his glory? I am but a man, who am I to bring these people to glory? Who am I to seek to cause the division?"
  },
