    "en": "Leo Notes"
  },
  {
    "row": 777,
    "type": "NOTE:TNAM",
    "editor": "MegatonGenericBrassLanternLeoNotesAFTER",
    "en": "Ever since that stranger helped Leo out with his problem, his counts have been coming up clean. I can't believe that he managed to hide his habits from me all this time. I guess we've grown apart over the last few years. That's something I'll have to work on fixing."
  },
  {
    "row": 778,
    "type": "NOTE:FULL",
    "editor": "MegatonGenericBrassLanternCashNotesAFTER",
    "en": "Leo Notes"
  },
  {
    "row": 779,
    "type": "NOTE:TNAM",
    "editor": "MegatonGenericBrassLanternCashNotesAFTER",
    "en": "Leo's count came up short again this month. 124 caps this time. I'll have to keep an eye on him. He's either careless or a thief. And now the safe is coming up short too but Leo couldn't use a computer to save his life... could he?"
  },
